ns, and aromatic woods, in demand everywhere, tin and gold destined for India, and animal products (rhinoceros horn, tortoiseshell, and the feathers of kingfishers and other brightly coloured birds) for China." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2793, 'temperature': 0.2})
