icant that some of the beads unearthed at Igbo-Ukwu were of local origin. In more recent times, the Igala country has been a major source of the supply of a variety of beads to the Igbo people, and it is probable that this trade had existed for a long time.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2826, 'temperature': 0.2})
